DAEMON
  start [name] [--foreground]                    Launch the flock
  shell                                          Open the interactive goose shell
  status                                         Inspect runtime state
  help [page|command|all]                        Show this help
  quit                                           Clear every goose and stop
  e.g. CppGoose start "Pip"
  e.g. CppGoose help skins

FLOCK
  spawn [name]                                   Add a goose
  clear                                          Remove every goose
  freeze [on|off|toggle]                         Freeze or unfreeze every goose
  ram                                            Show memory telemetry
  e.g. CppGoose spawn "Pip"

SKINS
  skins list                                     List items and saved looks
  skins show <id>                                Inspect one goose's outfit
  skins equip <id> <look>                        Equip a preset or saved look
  skins set <id> <hat|glasses> <item|none>       Mix hat and glasses
  skins save <id> <look>                         Save the current outfit as a look
  skins delete <look>                            Delete a saved look
  e.g. CppGoose skins equip 0 party
  e.g. CppGoose skins set 0 glasses shades

SETTINGS
  settings list                                  List every setting
  settings get <key>                             Read one value
  settings set <key> <value>                     Change one value
  e.g. CppGoose settings get walk_speed
  e.g. CppGoose settings set mud_chance 30

RULES
  rules list                                     List active rules
  rules add <id|all> <action> [interval] [text]  Schedule wander|meme|note|chase|text
  rules remove <rule-id>                         Delete one rule
  rules clear                                    Delete every rule
  e.g. CppGoose rules add all meme 30

FORCE
